        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UXiR0BeScdLjWm2d1sKE-19" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=default;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;ol start=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(78, 78, 78); margin: 0.75em 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: decimal; padding-inline-start: 1.625em; margin-block: 0px; color: rgb(78, 78, 78); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;text-start&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(78, 78, 78); margin: 0.5em 0px; padding: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0.375em; margin-block: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;在&lt;code class=&quot;codespan cursor-pointer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(235, 87, 87); margin: 0px; padding: 3px 8px; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 0.8em; cursor: pointer; width: auto; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(235, 87, 87); margin-inline: 2px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236);&quot;&gt;PreSleep&lt;/code&gt;阶段重复调用清除命令时，驱动由于硬件或软件策略可能忽略重复清除，导致唤醒标志没有被真正清零；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;text-start&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(78, 78, 78); margin: 0.5em 0px; padding: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0.375em; margin-block: 0px;&quot;&gt;这样，当网络状态变回&lt;code class=&quot;codespan cursor-pointer&quot; style=&quot;background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(235, 87, 87); margin: 0px; padding: 3px 8px; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 0.8em; cursor: pointer; width: auto; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(235, 87, 87); margin-inline: 2px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Repeat Message&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(78, 78, 78), rgb(170, 170, 170)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;时，系统检测到唤醒标志依旧存在，会误判出现了未处理的唤醒事件，触发“重复唤醒”；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;text-start&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(78, 78, 78); margin: 0.5em 0px; padding: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0.375em; margin-block: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;为了避免这个错误状态，必须在网络切换回活跃状态时重新启用唤醒模式，让收发器能够正确检测并响应后续的唤醒事件。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="560" x="3895" y="2330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
